{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"id\":58704,\"title\":\"Bering Sea Gold\",\"tagline\":\"\",\"overview\":\"In the frontier town of Nome, Alaska, there’s a gold rush on. But you've never seen gold mining like this before — here, the precious metal isn't found in the ground. It’s sitting in the most unlikely of places: the bottom of the frigid, unpredictable Bering Sea. And there are a handful of people willing to risk it all to bring it to the surface.\",\"posterPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jrMvJCbdBEA6UphJhL4kgtmY5Pw.jpg\",\"backdropPath\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/jQD4XN0FFDElt9e8tFswiL7mibU.jpg\",\"youtubeBackdrop\":null,\"anilistBanner\":null,\"rating\":6.5,\"voteCount\":44,\"year\":2012,\"genres\":[\"Documentary\",\"Reality\"],\"status\":\"Returning Series\",\"type\":\"tv\",\"totalSeasons\":19,\"totalEpisodes\":201,\"createdBy\":[],\"networks\":[\"Discovery\"],\"countries\":[{\"code\":\"US\",\"name\":\"United States of America\"}],\"lastAirDate\":\"2025-10-10\",\"cast\":[{\"id\":3286241,\"name\":\"Shawn Pomrenke\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/3DpeQUMLvBywWDnfTHo2bK4vU0y.jpg\"},{\"id\":3286245,\"name\":\"Vernon Adkison\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/mK7MFmb6EOfvax5sR1p3uOceMVb.jpg\"},{\"id\":3286247,\"name\":\"Zeke Tenhoff\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/8OmiDRJfo5JNdjsJEHpgcgYR5CA.jpg\"},{\"id\":3286250,\"name\":\"Kris Kelly\",\"character\":\"Self\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pH6aerkqblBCLvHXzJLZKbhTgCt.jpg\"},{\"id\":1215558,\"name\":\"Mike Rowe\",\"character\":\"Himself (Narrator)\",\"photo\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rkNnugOmkMD1sXPCSQK1UZFAoWE.jpg\"}],\"trailers\":[{\"key\":\"BUlCNV6s1jc\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"mjiLNoYfpE4\",\"name\":\"Official Trailer\",\"site\":\"YouTube\",\"type\":\"Trailer\"},{\"key\":\"VIiNi-MzCVk\",\"n