ore\":0.2272727272727273,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":62041,\"title\":\"Alaska: Earth's Frozen Kingdom\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/w2WXnM9xRMHt57ls5gH1PeglUyV.jpg\",\"rating\":6.5,\"year\":2015,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.225,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":128493,\"title\":\"Gold Rush: Winter's Fortune\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/kK7W4fzovQQ5UPtDc7gbZfujDcf.jpg\",\"rating\":8.1,\"year\":2021,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.22181818181818183,\"_genreOverlap\":1},{\"id\":64982,\"title\":\"Alaska Monsters\",\"poster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/sM41ap1J43tARURhVIqJYYmbkIn.jpg\",\"rating\":4,\"year\":2014,\"type\":\"tv\",\"_score\":0.21690140845070424,\"_genreOverlap\":1}],\"seasonNumber\":5,\"seasonName\":\"Season 5\",\"seasonOverview\":\"\",\"seasonPoster\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/9OrrPqqFMEJllsRLgq5fjpB5UXO.jpg\",\"seasonAirDate\":\"2015-09-04\",\"episodes\":[{\"number\":1,\"name\":\"Countdown to Gold\",\"overview\":\"This winter, strict deadlines force the fleet to take extreme measures. Vern gambles on a state of the art dredge while Shawn ventures into the harsh wilderness in search of the next golden hotspot and Emily unleashes a team of all girl divers on Nome.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/1LipJy3EPA9E9Ft3qgXLVp0Nhxn.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-04\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":2,\"name\":\"Girl Drama\",\"overview\":\"With a shortened season, every second counts. But just as the fleet seems set to dial in on the gold, equipment problems cause setbacks, costing each crew precious time under the water.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/iypbJ1r1RG0OqDOOaQURheqZ8hA.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-11\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":3,\"name\":\"The Quest\",\"overview\":\"Near the midpoint of the shortened mining season, every dredge must hustle to stay on the gold. But in their haste, small miscalculations lead to massive problems, throwing every operation into question.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hyhW9lKAmYf0ijroCidjXw3Naqj.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-18\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"Baggage\",\"overview\":\"Through the halfway point of the ice mining season, every operation is pulling out all the stops to make it pay. But they&apos;ll have to contend with the weight of the past before they can land the riches\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pQqjvgs87f17Lwn9T6tLracKjP4.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-09-25\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"The Blizzard\",\"overview\":\"With less than a week in the shortest ice mining season on record, every crew is battling the clock. But just when they think it couldn't get any harder, a massive Arctic storm descends on Nome.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/hjZEFvq0xlbd1heqa0Fn3PaOf2d.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-02\",\"runtime\":0},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"The Deadline\",\"overview\":\"After a month out on the ice, one day remains in the 2015 ice mining season. For every miner, that's one more day to prove that a season full of risks was worth the cost.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/faW6LAqk4QYaWyDKtk7qYKu8TcV.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2015-10-09\",\"runtime\":0}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2012-01-27\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}